# HOME Localization Rules for AI Assistants

- Single Source of Truth: All translations must be in `translation/text_export.xlsx` and `translation/ui_export.csv`.
- Never modify engine control tags: `[if]`, `[endif]`, `[jump]`, `[macro]`, `[endmacro]`, `[iscript]`, `[endscript]`, `[commit]`, `[playse]`.
- Always use `[r]` for dialog line breaks. Do not use `\n`.
- Keep `tools/` clean: Only use core pipeline tools (`build_pc_patch.py`, `verify_patch_integrity.py`, `reimport_scenario.py`, `setup_fonts.py`, `unified_patch_installer.py`).
- Always run `python tools/verify_patch_integrity.py` to ensure 0 errors before release.
- Build command: `python tools/build_pc_patch.py`
